      "content": "The Sendbird Platform API provides server-side access to manage users, channels, messages, and moderation for in-app chat applications built on Sendbird. Supports group channels, open channels, direct messages, push notifications, and webhooks for real-time communication features.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Sendbird Support",
